"""Write release status from local verification evidence."""
import json
import subprocess
from pathlib import Path
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]


def main():
    path=ROOT/'outputs/metrics/release_validation.json'
    v=json.loads(path.read_text()) if path.exists() else None
    rows=[]
    if v:
        c=v['checks'];t=c['tests']
        rows=[f"Fresh local clone tested source commit `{v['tested_source_commit']}` in the recorded installed release environment.",f"The configured full suite ran {t['tests']} tests with {t['failures']} failures, {t['errors']} errors and {t['skipped']} skips. The isolated demo also completed its fixture suite.",f"The report build returned {c['report']['returncode']} and produced {c['report'].get('pages')} US Letter pages. The results notebook executed top to bottom. Hygiene returned {c['hygiene']['returncode']} and lint returned {c['lint']['returncode']}.",f"Strict replay returned {c['strict_replay']['returncode']}. Its byte comparison remains failed. Published metrics are unchanged: {c['published_metrics_unchanged']}."]
    else:rows=['Final fresh-clone validation is pending. Earlier local fixture and contract tests passed.']
    content=['# Implementation audit','','## Local verification','']+['\n\n'.join(rows)]+['','The replay audit ran two same-environment frozen fits. They matched each other, while Prophet authority metrics differed from the publication. Every other JSON field matched exactly. The cause remains unresolved. See [freeze scope](freeze_scope.md).','','## Individual component ports','','The [component inventory](component_port_plan.md) was recorded before copying. The verified bundle HEAD is `afa56acaef5e42093c9ad57c4b057586f91906c5`. Each component was ported individually with the full source SHA in its commit message. The temporary ref was removed. No histories were merged.','','| Component | Current execution evidence |','| --- | --- |','| Demo and Makefile | Isolated synthetic pipeline and configured suite passed |','| Interval store | SQLite transaction failure, recovery, revision and stale-replay contract passed |','| Forecast status | Missing output and DST target contract passed |','| Event validation | Equal-budget and catalog-boundary tests passed. Metrics recomputed on release hourly data |','| Interval DAG | Local Airflow import and task dependency edge passed. Both DAGs discovered |','| Compose | Configuration inspected. Docker unavailable, so service startup unverified |','| CI | Workflow adapted to current dependencies and PDF build. Hosted result unverified |','| Publication | Metric-driven report, README, vector figures and employer PDF built locally |','','Network PostgreSQL, live API operation, hosted CI and unattended uptime remain unverified. The historical full-snapshot verification is an opt-in check outside the configured fixture suite and was not rerun here. Raw source files remain ignored. The two protected untracked folders were not modified.','','## Literature and bibliography','','The requested reviewed source is missing at its specified Downloads location. No literature-review wording was reconstructed and no edits to that missing text were made. The complete reference list cannot be enumerated or verified without it. The report uses a separate limited bibliography whose checks are logged in [reference_verification.csv](reference_verification.csv). All entries in that limited bibliography are verified through a publisher, Crossref or authoritative university index. Operational documentation is labeled gray literature.','','## Publication previews','','The PDF was rendered to PNG for local page inspection. Local preview files are in `reports/previews/`. README HTML and document-rendered PNG previews are labeled local. A GitHub-rendered screenshot is unverified. The release contains no claim of hosted rendering or CI success.','','## Remaining limits','','The reviewed literature source and original Prophet scoring runtime remain outstanding. CISO storage correction is unsupported by the observed dedicated battery field. Seasonal OASIS differences support demand-definition caveats and do not establish model superiority. No branch, tag, merge, release or About-panel update was published.']
    (ROOT/'docs/implementation_audit.md').write_text('\n'.join(content)+'\n')
    commits=subprocess.check_output(['git','log','--reverse','--format=%h %s','bf7169c..HEAD'],cwd=ROOT,text=True).strip()
    status=['# Release preparation status','','## Access and preservation','','Step 0 switched successfully to `release/v1` at `bf7169c`. Status showed only the two protected untracked folders. The freeze tag was absent and was then created as an annotated local tag at `53d75a23d37021f25f0a62449420fbc5621c2084`. Its annotation explicitly records that it was added after scoring.','','The original replay commits remain in history. Frozen source files and the published forecast JSON are unchanged. See [freeze scope](freeze_scope.md).','','## Operator-data gate','','All seasonal OASIS reports validated. The April files were preserved. Remaining files were acquired sequentially under the prescribed pacing and attempt policy. Exact URLs, targets, attempt times, hashes and report coverage are in the [request manifest](../verification/oasis_download_requests.json). Findings and supported sensitivities are in [operator definitions](operator_definitions.md).','','## Validation','', '\n\n'.join(rows),'','## Local commits','','```text',commits,'```','','This list records the implementation source history before the final status-record commit. The final local Git log supplies the complete commit list.','','## Outstanding inputs and unverified environments','','The literature source remains missing. Its original wording and full reference list cannot be processed. The strict replay failure remains unresolved. Docker, network PostgreSQL, hosted CI and GitHub rendering require their own verification. No publication action was taken.']
    (ROOT/'docs/release_preparation_status.md').write_text('\n'.join(status)+'\n')


if __name__=='__main__':main()
